# Security headers para zentigrants.com — honrados por Cloudflare Pages.
# GitHub Pages IGNORA este archivo (no soporta headers custom) — por eso es
# seguro tenerlo commiteado antes de migrar el hosting.
#
# CSP calibrado al inventario real de la landing (2026-07-20):
#   - GA4 (googletagmanager/google-analytics), Leaflet vía unpkg, tiles ArcGIS,
#     Google Fonts, webhooks n8n (forms/status/waitlist), funds.json local.
#   - 'unsafe-inline' en script/style es deliberado: la landing tiene 7 bloques
#     <script> y ~139 estilos inline; el CSP igual bloquea CARGAS de orígenes
#     no listados, que es el vector principal en un sitio estático.

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://unpkg.com https://www.googletagmanager.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com https://unpkg.com; font-src 'self' data: https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; connect-src 'self' https://zenti.app.n8n.cloud https://*.google-analytics.com https://*.googletagmanager.com https://*.analytics.google.com; form-action 'self' https://zenti.app.n8n.cloud; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
